# Local file-first vault used by pnpm dev:local
.waka-vault-local/

# Throwaway browser probes, which have to sit in the repo root.
#
# A one-off question about the running world ("is anything covering this
# control's centre?") is answered by a short Playwright script, and `tsx`
# resolves `playwright` from the root — so the root is where such a script has
# to live. They are written, read once, and deleted; none of them is a gate and
# none should ever be committed. Ignored by name so a probe in flight does not
# make the tree look dirty, and so nobody is tempted to commit one to make a
# hook stop complaining.
*-probe.ts

# `e2e:snapshot` writes this to the repo root: a scratch reading of every
# computed style, for comparing two runs by hand. Not a committed baseline —
# nothing reads it back — so running that gate should not dirty the tree.
snap.json

# Regenerable synthetic audio evaluation inputs and per-run output.
/work/audio-transcription-eval/
/work/reflection-eval/
/work/review-eval/
